sequenceDiagram
  actor Client as Client Main automatic
  participant Selector as StrategySelector
  participant Planner as RoutePlanner
  participant Fastest as FastestRouteStrategy
  participant Checker as ConstraintChecker
  Client->>Selector: select(urgentRequest)
  Selector-->>Client: RouteStrategy Fastest
  Client->>Planner: setStrategy(strategy)
  Client->>Planner: plan(routes, urgentRequest)
  Planner->>Fastest: selectRoute(routes, urgentRequest)
  Note over Fastest: Inherited pipeline from AbstractRouteStrategy
  Fastest->>Checker: assess(routes, urgentRequest)
  Checker-->>Fastest: List of RouteAssessment
  Fastest->>Fastest: score feasible routes and break ties by id
  Fastest-->>Planner: RouteDecision with winner and assessments
  Planner-->>Client: RouteDecision
